{"parentUuid":"b3cf8ae9-a891-4fec-9f98-4991901d0300","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a554eed87317d112b","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfzumZeu3j5iXff4q1gqz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NAc416X7nfib1yB3qvKXgb","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\cuore\\live\\owner_events.py","offset":20,"limit":30},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":601,"cache_read_input_tokens":170239,"output_tokens":571,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":452},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":601},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":170239,"cache_creation_input_tokens":601,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":601,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01NAc416X7nfib1yB3qvKXgb":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\cuore\\live\\owner_events.py","offset":20,"limit":30}},"serverClassifierRequest":"429ce3e4-8a1a-4eee-ac30-d7181acbd100","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfzumZQXeSQ2mN739Z24C","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc8b8d50-6d50-43e7-84cb-bae57d4f28bb","timestamp":"2026-10-13T21:01:24.787Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"cc8b8d50-6d50-43e7-84cb-bae57d4f28bb","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"32e1d820-4c02-417b-9eb5-eb28de0dd113","agentId":"a554eed87317d112b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NAc416X7nfib1yB3qvKXgb","type":"tool_result","content":"20\tAppend-only JSONL under ``cuore.live.config.state_dir()`` (``CUORE_STATE_DIR``,\n21\tsame precedence as every other cuore live store), one file,\n22\t``owner_events.jsonl``, two record shapes distinguished by ``op``:\n23\t\n24\t* ``event`` -- {op, id, vin, at, recorded_at, by: {role, name}, category,\n25\t  kind, fields, note, media_ids, odometer_km, confidence=\"reported\"}\n26\t* ``delete``-- {op, id, at} -- marks an event hidden (soft delete)\n27\t\n28\tThis module owns the taxonomy -- the single source of truth the add/list\n29\tform, the API's validation, and the timeline lane all read from -- plus\n30\tplain append/soft-delete/load. Everything that reaches outside ``cuore.live``\n31\t(systems lookups, correlation against DTC history, the feedback/inbox\n32\t\"messages\" bridge) lives in ``cuore.services.owner_events_bridge`` instead,\n33\tsame split ``cuore.live.media`` / nothing-yet-equivalent keeps.\n34\t\"\"\"\n35\t\n36\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n37\t\n38\timport json\n39\timport threading\n40\timport uuid\n41\tfrom datetime import datetime\n42\tfrom pathlib import Path\n43\tfrom typing import Any, Optional\n44\t\n45\tfrom .config import state_dir\n46\t\n47\t_LOCK = threading.Lock()\n48\t\n49\tMAX_NOTE = 4000"}]},"uuid":"8f4e74b0-fcb8-4e2c-89c5-28b04d193236","timestamp":"2026-10-13T21:01:24.848Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\cuore\\live\\owner_events.py","content":"Append-only JSONL under ``cuore.live.config.state_dir()`` (``CUORE_STATE_DIR``,\nsame precedence as every other cuore live store), one file,\n``owner_events.jsonl``, two record shapes distinguished by ``op``:\n\n* ``event`` -- {op, id, vin, at, recorded_at, by: {role, name}, category,\n  kind, fields, note, media_ids, odometer_km, confidence=\"reported\"}\n* ``delete``-- {op, id, at} -- marks an event hidden (soft delete)\n\nThis module owns the taxonomy -- the single source of truth the add/list\nform, the API's validation, and the timeline lane all read from -- plus\nplain append/soft-delete/load. Everything that reaches outside ``cuore.live``\n(systems lookups, correlation against DTC history, the feedback/inbox\n\"messages\" bridge) lives in ``cuore.services.owner_events_bridge`` instead,\nsame split ``cuore.live.media`` / nothing-yet-equivalent keeps.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport json\nimport threading\nimport uuid\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom typing import Any, Optional\n\nfrom .config import state_dir\n\n_LOCK = threading.Lock()\n\nMAX_NOTE = 4000","numLines":30,"startLine":20,"totalLines":766}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cc8b8d50-6d50-43e7-84cb-bae57d4f28bb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"8f4e74b0-fcb8-4e2c-89c5-28b04d193236","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a554eed87317d112b","attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14828587 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"10e1b2fb-b3d3-4249-80d3-eb7c919c8c20","timestamp":"2026-10-13T21:01:24.893Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14828587 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"10e1b2fb-b3d3-4249-80d3-eb7c919c8c20","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a554eed87317d112b","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfzunEUWu6kPzFizPLPFq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VPzRrQ5iTyJrTcATnek124","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\cuore\\live\\owner_events.py","old_string":"* ``event`` -- {op, id, vin, at, recorded_at, by: {role, name}, category,\n  kind, fields, note, media_ids, odometer_km, confidence=\"reported\"}\n* ``delete``-- {op, id, at} -- marks an event hidden (soft delete)","new_string":"* ``event`` -- {op, id, vin, at, recorded_at, by: {role, name}, category,\n  kind, fields, fields_meta, note, media_ids, odometer_km, confidence=\"reported\"}\n* ``delete``-- {op, id, at} -- marks an event hidden (soft delete)\n\n``fields_meta`` (added 2026-10-13, additive -- older rows simply have none)\nis ``{field_key: \"photo\"}`` for any field whose value was read off a photo\nby the Mobile \"Snap & fill\" screen (``cuore.web.owner_routes``) rather than\ntyped by the person -- see that module's own docstring for the contract\nwith ``cuore.services.vision_bridge``. It is informational only: a\nphoto-read field is stored at the same ``confidence: \"reported\"`` as every\nother owner-typed value (a human still tapped Save), this just remembers\n*how* the value got into the box, for the \"check before saving\" amber chip\nand for anyone auditing the report later."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1119,"cache_read_input_tokens":170840,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1119,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01VPzRrQ5iTyJrTcATnek124":{"file